  {"i":604,"t":["feelings"],"s":{},"n":"An exclamation of praise or encouragement, taught with the other emotional interjections; it is not a greeting or set phrase."},
  {"i":618,"t":["actions"],"s":{},"n":"A manner adverb for doing something gently or quietly, taught with actions. It is not a degree or negation adverb."},
  {"i":623,"t":["calendar","time","function"],"s":{},"n":"'What year' fits calendar and 'how many years / how long' is duration, so time is added; as a question word it also fits function."},
  {"i":632,"t":["actions"],"s":{"2":["drink"]},"n":"The core sense, as in 一気に, is doing something in one go, a manner of action. The drinking call 'chug!' is a separate sense under drink."},
  {"i":634,"t":["feelings"],"s":{"2":["body"]},"n":"Mainly taught as the curse 'damn', an outburst of frustration. The 'feces' sense belongs to body, and the slang intensifier is too marginal to add function."},
  {"i":734,"t":["qualities","measures"],"s":{},"n":"'Size' is first a word for describing things; measures is a secondary unit for dimensions and volume."},
  {"i":748,"t":["actions"],"s":{},"n":"A manner adverb (doing something secretly), labelled the same as そっと. It is not a function word."}
 ],
